   "en": "It was stated in the mishna: «And the same» is true with regard to «one’s son.» The Gemara is surprised: «What is his son doing there» in the field necessitating his retrieval in this way? «The school of Menashe taught:» It is referring to a case «where his mother gave birth to him in a field,» and he must be brought to town."
